lines+=['','The current red-team unsafe-suppression, private-obligation, inherited-context and milestone cases are evaluated without sidecars. The earlier 27 controls are retained alongside the 21 red-team cases, eight new scope guards, two mixed-duty guards and two private/clinical-heading guards. See the complete per-case results, including original failures and any rebuilt failures, in scope-repair/control-results-release.json. Replaying the exact preserved earlier rebuilt B card with the before/after validators changes five personal warning IDs to zero; the source and raw card are identical in both executions (scope-repair/same-card-warning-replay.json). Exact new anchors remain accepted; altered citations and quotation text remain rejected. Original’s known permissive quotation behavior is disclosed rather than scored as fidelity success.','',f"Historical replay executions: {len(replay)}; repaired rebuild failures: {len([x for x in replay if x['arm']=='rebuild' and not x['passed']])}. The same historical REVIEW lines and valid/invalid outcomes are required; old result files were not regenerated. The replay follows each original recorded command, including multipart cards. Prior failed replay-wrapper and delivery attempts remain in their original folders; this stage does not rewrite them.",'','## Fresh short model cases','','| Case | Original strict / semantic / no false personal hints | Rebuild strict / semantic / no false personal hints |','|---|---|---|']
